;; tenfiftybakers.com.au: import into Cloudflare (DNS → Records → Import and Export → Import).
;; UNTICK "Proxy imported DNS records": every record here must be DNS only.
;; Website records (root and www) are NOT here: adding the domain as a Custom
;; Domain on the decra-sites worker creates them.
;; No email on this domain (23 Oct 2026): it sends and receives nothing, so
;; these two records tell receivers to reject any mail claiming to be from it.
tenfiftybakers.com.au.	3600	IN	TXT	"v=spf1 -all"
_dmarc.tenfiftybakers.com.au.	3600	IN	TXT	"v=DMARC1; p=reject;"
